        <activityName xml:lang="en">Spare screen, for smartphone, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Spare screen, for smartphone, at plant
The data set represents the production of smartphone spare screen.; UUID: 21996090-12f4-38e0-9dbc-a0fae8de89d2
The dataset for smartphone spare screen is modeled as a separate LCD display with the size of 75.5 cm2, equivalent to 30 grams of LCD module.
Location: Data for global average screen for smartphone
Technology: The production of smartphone screen requires LED technologies as the backlight for typical LCD screens.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_21996090-12f4-38e0-9dbc-a0fae8de89d2.xml</text>
